lanation":"狗是 dog。","verify":"\"It is a dog.\""},{"id":"cne_p018_q4","topicId":"cne_p018","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Look! That is a bird. 远处的是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猫"},{"key":"B","text":"狗"},{"key":"C","text":"鸟"},{"key":"D","text":"鸭子"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"bird 是鸟。","verify":"\"鸟\""},{"id":"cne_p019_q1","topicId":"cne_p019","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：This is a cat. It is black. 这是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猫"},{"key":"B","text":"狗"},{"key":"C","text":"鸟"},{"key":"D","text":"鸭子"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"cat 是猫。","verify":"\"猫\""},{"id":"cne_p019_q2","topicId":"cne_p019","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：That is a duck. It is yellow. 鸭子是什么颜色？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"黑色"},{"key":"B","text":"黄色"},{"key":"C","text":"蓝色"},{"key":"D","text":"绿色"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"文字写 It is yellow。","verify":"\"黄色\""},{"id":"cne_p019_q3","topicId":"cne_p019","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I see a dog. 哪一句和文字一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"我看见一只猫。"},{"key":"B","text":"我看见一只鸟。"},{"key":"C","text":"我看见一只狗。"},{"key":"D","text":"我看见一只鸭子。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"dog 是狗。","verify":"\"我看见一只狗。\""},{"id":"cne_p019_q4","topicId":"cne_p019","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：This is a bird. It is blue. 哪一句是对的？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"鸟是红色的。"},{"key":"B","text":"猫是蓝色的。"},{"key":"C","text":"鸭子是蓝色的。"},{"key":"D","text":"鸟是蓝色的。"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"文字说的是 bird，颜色是 blue。","verify":"\"鸟是蓝色的。\""},{"id":"cne_p040_q1","topicId":"cne_p040","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「大的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"small"},{"key":"B","text":"big"},{"key":"C","text":"tall"},{"key":"D","text":"short"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"big 的意思是大的。","verify":"\"big\""},{"id":"cne_p040_q2","topicId":"cne_p040","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「small」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"大的"},{"key":"B","text":"高的"},{"key":"C","text":"小的"},{"key":"D","text":"矮的"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"small 的意思是小的。","verify":"\"小的\""},{"id":"cne_p040_q3","topicId":"cne_p040","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「高的」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"big"},{"key":"B","text":"small"},{"key":"C","text":"short"},{"key":"D","text":"tall"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"表示高的的单词是 tall。","verify":"\"tall\""},{"id":"cne_p040_q4","topicId":"cne_p040","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「矮的」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"short"},{"key":"B","text":"big"},{"key":"C","text":"small"},{"key":"D","text":"tall"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"short 的意思是矮的。","verify":"\"short\""},{"id":"cne_p041_q1","topicId":"cne_p041","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句表示「它很小」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It is tall."},{"key":"B","text":"It is big."},{"key":"C","text":"It is small."},{"key":"D","text":"It is long."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"小的是 small。","verify":"\"It is small.\""},{"id":"cne_p041_q2","topicId":"cne_p041","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Look at the elephant. It is big. 大象怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很小"},{"key":"B","text":"很矮"},{"key":"C","text":"很短"},{"key":"D","text":"很大"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"big 是大的。","verify":"\"很大\""},{"id":"cne_p041_q3","topicId":"cne_p041","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The giraffe is tall. 长颈鹿怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很高"},{"key":"B","text":"很矮"},{"key":"C","text":"很小"},{"key":"D","text":"很短"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"tall 是高的。","verify":"\"很高\""},{"id":"cne_p041_q4","topicId":"cne_p041","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"It is short. 这句的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"它很高"},{"key":"B","text":"它很矮"},{"key":"C","text":"它很大"},{"key":"D","text":"它很长"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"在这一课里 short 是矮的。","verify":"\"它很矮\""},{"id":"cne_p042_q1","topicId":"cne_p042","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：Look at the bear. It is big. 熊怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很小"},{"key":"B","text":"很矮"},{"key":"C","text":"很瘦"},{"key":"D","text":"很大"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"文字写 It is big。","verify":"\"很大\""},{"id":"cne_p042_q2","topicId":"cne_p042","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：The monkey is small. 哪一句和文字一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猴子很小。"},{"key":"B","text":"猴子很大。"},{"key":"C","text":"猴子很高。"},{"key":"D","text":"熊很小。"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"monkey 是猴子，small 是小。","verify":"\"猴子很小。\""},{"id":"cne_p042_q3","topicId":"cne_p042","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：The giraffe is tall. The cat is short. 谁很高？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猫"},{"key":"B","text":"长颈鹿"},{"key":"C","text":"熊"},{"key":"D","text":"猴子"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"giraffe is tall。","verify":"\"长颈鹿\""},{"id":"cne_p042_q4","topicId":"cne_p042","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：It is a pig. It is big. 又大的动物是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"猫"},{"key":"B","text":"鸟"},{"key":"C","text":"猪"},{"key":"D","text":"鸭子"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"pig 是猪。","verify":"\"猪\""}]
